    "title": "Onondaga County Sheriff's Office Announces Arrest in Series of Public Lewdness Incidents; Seeking Additional Witnesses - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Stephanie Powers ,\n12 hours ago The Onondaga County Sheriff’s Office (OCSO) announces the arrest of Eric N. Higley, 30, from the Town of Salina in connection with multiple incidents of Public Lewdness (NYS PL §245.00, Class B Misdemeanor) that occurred in the parking lot of T.J. Maxx, 3841 Route 31, Town of Clay, during 2025. The arrest resulted from a joint investigation by the Criminal Investigations Division (CID) and Patrol. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
